    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Aspen offers a unique living experience for residents, empowering you to live, work and socialise all under one roof, with spaces designed with your happiness and wellbeing in mind.\r\n\r\nWe’ve got a great range of stylish living options to suit all budgets and needs, from self-contained studios to comfy shared apartments, and they all come with free super-fast WIFI. Aspen also has a long list of onsite facilities for you to explore and enjoy, including a big common area, cinema, gym, games room and more.\r\n\r\nYou can find us right on the edge of Dublin city centre – a world-class city with a rich history that’s full of exciting things to see and do. At Aspen, you’ll be able to explore the restaurants, bars, shops, sports facilities and cultural destinations right on your doorstep, and all within easy travelling distance to Dublin’s main universities, including Dublin City university, which is just a 10 minute walk away.\r\n\r\nExplore our community - Aspen Student Life!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "A range of rooms to suit everyone's needs - All rooms are Private en-Suite in either a 4 bed/ 6 bed or 7 bed apartment.\r\n\r\n7 Bed apt = €225/week\r\n7 Bed apt = (High Floor/Penthouse) €250-€255/week\r\n6 Bed apt = €240/week\r\n4 Bed apt = €260/week\r\n\r\nDisable Access/ DAC Rooms Available"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "All bills included\r\nFree superfast wifi\r\nFree Gym\r\nFree access to- Cinema room/ games room/ study room/ private dining area\r\nRoof Top Terrace\r\nLandscape Gardens"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A1"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "10 mins walk from DCU\r\n10 mins bus from TU Grangegorman (bus no. 4/155)\r\n30 min bus from TU Blanchardstown (bus no. 17A)\r\n20 mins bus from Trinity College (bus no.13/4/155)\r\n20 mins bus from Dublin Business School (bus no.13/4/155)\r\n\r\nLocated on the main Ballymun Road and on the corner of Shangan Road Dublin 11 right in the heart of Ballymun."
      },
      {
